is a root commit (`Initial fixture`). Author and committer are both `Corpus fixture <fixture@example.invalid>`.\n\nMailmap-aware shortlog over all refs:\n\n```text\n     1\tCorpus fixture\n```\n\nWith email: `1  Corpus fixture <fixture@example.invalid>`. There is no `.mailmap` file and no `mailmap.file` or `mailmap.blob` config. `git log --all --use-mailmap` and `--no-use-mailmap` both print `Corpus fixture <fixture@example.invalid>`.\n\n## Gotchas\n\nDuplicate identities do not affect this count. There is one name and one email, and the author and committer are the same person. Mailmap has no mapping to apply, so it does not merge or split anyone.\n\nMerges do not affect it either. `git rev-list --all --merges --count` is **0**, and `--no-merges` is **1**. The only commit has no parents, so the all-ref total is not inflated by merge commits, and the author tally is one commit from one person."}}],"agentId":"0f9b3234-e4a7-444c-921f-2461c1f5bb9a","isBackground":false,"durationMs":"31124","backgroundReason":"SUBAGENT_BACKGROUND_REASON_UNSPECIFIED"}}},"hookAdditionalContexts":[],"toolCallId":"call_gqoEoeHV48RkWv9xCgBoRBLe\nfc_0ffed92538d32a99016aef531e094087d19820779d025cacc2","startedAtMs":"1794069278178","completedAtMs":"1794069309316"},"model_call_id":"865520dc-677b-4d92-92aa-020e42090c8d-5-maqt","session_id":"c9180b27-719d-414b-98d0-adb026b3493c","timestamp_ms":1794069309339}
